# Test Conventions

Config: `pytest.ini` — 10s timeout, `integration` marker skipped by default.

## Layout

- Primary suite: `tests/test_*.py` (67 files)
- Scaffold smoke: `scaffold/tests/`
- Fixtures: `tests/fixtures/wedge_v1/`, `tests/fixtures/benchmark/`
- Legacy root `test_*.py` — superseded; don't add new tests there

## Patterns

- Mock LLM calls; no real API in unit tests unless `@pytest.mark.integration`
- `test_vector_memory.py` ignored by default (ChromaDB dependency)
- Wedge corpus tests: `test_ci_rescue_sprint_corpus.py`, `test_code_evolution_corpus.py`
- Self-learning: `test_p1_improvements.py` through `test_p9_confidence.py`

## After kernel changes

```bash
pytest tests/test_<feature>.py -q --timeout=10
pytest -q --timeout=10  # full suite before commit
```

Kernel/CLI features also need **live proof** (`scripts/demo_*.sh`) — unit tests alone insufficient.
